    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“Velocity is not speed. It is direction maintained under pressure.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Archetype (Bad Eden): The Chariot (Squad Leader).</strong> Field commander, momentum-anchor, and small-unit tactician. You turn chaos into movement and movement into victory.</p>\n<h3>Archetype Effects</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Faction Edge.</strong> This Archetype is associated with <strong>+1 Violence</strong> and <strong>+1 Intrigue</strong> in faction calculus, reflecting mixed-method tactical control.</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier Engine.</strong> See this Archetype’s Tier feats (Tier 1–4) for the full tactical and strategic expression of squad command, coordinated action, and breach momentum.</li>\n</ul>",
